(Northstar Notes is a fictional collaborative notebook service. This document is) Tj T*
(synthetic evaluation data, not a real commercial policy. Workspace security applies to) Tj T*
(all eligible workspaces unless a signed contract explicitly overrides it. Administrators) Tj T*
(should share this guidance with workspace members when explaining service behavior.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All workspace data is encrypted at rest using AES-256. This rule is published in the) Tj T*
(workspace handbook. Contact the workspace owner if you cannot locate the related) Tj T*
(setting. Support staff can explain the published rule but cannot silently change a) Tj T*
(signed agreement. Keep the workspace identifier ready when opening a ticket.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Single sign-on with SAML is available only on the Enterprise plan. The service dashboard) Tj T*
(records the relevant activity so workspace administrators can review it. The support) Tj T*
(team does not require users to disclose their passwords. Questions about an exception) Tj T*
(must be directed to support with the affected workspace identifier. This document) Tj T*
(intentionally omits future features and unpublished policies.) Tj T*
